## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design scalable data lifecycle with multi-tenant governance and cost control; integrates Iceberg features, storage tiering, policy-driven retention, and query-layer masking.

## Key Concepts
- Iceberg time travel via snapshots
- Dynamic data tiering (hot/warm/cold)
- Per-tenant data masking
- Encryption at rest (KMS)
- Partition pruning and metadata caching

## Code Example
```javascript
function selectTier(tenant, ageDays) {
  const retention = (tenantRetention[tenant] || 365);
  if (ageDays < 30) return 'hot';
  if (ageDays < retention) return 'warm';
  return 'cold';
}
```

